Tests of the interactive interface of the interpreter-based debugger (v3db).
Each test runs "v3c -debug test.v3" with commands from test.v3.in and compares
the transcript to test.v3.out. Tests named tty_* also pass -debug-tty and
exercise line editing, so their input and output contain control characters.
A test.v3.args file lists additional source files, e.g. under lib/ and other/.
The protocol used by the VS Code extension (-debug-extension) is tested in
test/debug.
O3.skip lists the tests that do not apply at -O3; see test.bash.
